    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "20efce00-cc2b-3c00-8d0d-739d671f2aaa",
                "word": "magilla",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b6731675-0bf0-4f3d-8f51-592e4f33863d",
                        "entry_id": "20efce00-cc2b-3c00-8d0d-739d671f2aaa",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "magillas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d3a1f758-2e1e-3796-9197-47a0f648e65a",
                        "entry_id": "20efce00-cc2b-3c00-8d0d-739d671f2aaa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something large and/or elaborate (especially in the phrase \\\"the whole magilla\\\")"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b02de47-89ea-4946-a0ca-70a76fe4a86d",
                                "sense_id": "d3a1f758-2e1e-3796-9197-47a0f648e65a",
                                "text": "No, I didn't wear them. I got dressed up. Pantyhose, makeup, the whole magilla."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d99ea79e-13f5-4255-976a-caf294001b15",
                                "sense_id": "d3a1f758-2e1e-3796-9197-47a0f648e65a",
                                "text": "Before a Kohen duchans he's gotta have his hands washed by one of the Levites, it's a whole magilla, what do I know?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "efc7f81b-568e-4be9-8862-5254f565e8d3",
                                "sense_id": "d3a1f758-2e1e-3796-9197-47a0f648e65a",
                                "text": "I love your letters. They always bring me joy. Even the short ones. The magillas make me euphoric."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82cc8fe8-f32a-435d-9161-eb34924549f4",
                                "sense_id": "d3a1f758-2e1e-3796-9197-47a0f648e65a",
                                "text": "\"Dream House\" is the full magilla, with imaginary images, sanity questions, peek-a-boo startles and the usual are-they-real-or-not? characters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "46672656-8a54-4d1b-a98b-04f27a9cab36",
                                "sense_id": "d3a1f758-2e1e-3796-9197-47a0f648e65a",
                                "text": "I'm good at it, I get paid fairly well for it, and some day I'm going to be one of the people in charge of the whole magilla."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7ee43417-d1fb-34b2-9ee2-142bd1f60bff",
                        "entry_id": "20efce00-cc2b-3c00-8d0d-739d671f2aaa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A big fuss or messy situation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f26a68d-6a5b-4acb-98e9-a71de0bbe02e",
                                "sense_id": "7ee43417-d1fb-34b2-9ee2-142bd1f60bff",
                                "text": "Now after this magilla, please be ashamed of yourself and sit down & write a nice long letter"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a5949bf-9531-4291-9c54-50b6d7829560",
                                "sense_id": "7ee43417-d1fb-34b2-9ee2-142bd1f60bff",
                                "text": "Because I got into one of my magillas over what in hell to write you, Paul who thought I was crazy said that maybe he would apply for it instead but Gordon thought he was too successful."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "755287c2-07db-454e-9d04-41c6d63b0e4c",
                                "sense_id": "7ee43417-d1fb-34b2-9ee2-142bd1f60bff",
                                "text": "You can’t name it. It’s too big or evil or outside your experience. It’s also shit because it’s garbage, it’s waste material. But I’m making a whole big megillah out of this. What I really want to get at is the ordinary thing, the ordinary life behind the thing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d507c67-7af6-4f1a-b097-736822750f52",
                                "sense_id": "7ee43417-d1fb-34b2-9ee2-142bd1f60bff",
                                "text": "He didn't deserve this end and I am to blame for the whole magilla."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6afcaa8-ba93-4dae-a10f-b828c51719e0",
                                "sense_id": "7ee43417-d1fb-34b2-9ee2-142bd1f60bff",
                                "text": "The actor told Esquire about his epic Christmas parties: \"It's a big magilla to get an ice luge, but if you do, you can pour vodka into it and it chills it on the way down."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0239f04f-6b6e-3671-9eaf-0acd25a6af4d",
                        "entry_id": "20efce00-cc2b-3c00-8d0d-739d671f2aaa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An epitome; acme; exemplar."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e58d8eb-a719-4976-8a15-5a8988c3569c",
                                "sense_id": "0239f04f-6b6e-3671-9eaf-0acd25a6af4d",
                                "text": "“It's not just one more thing, this is the big magilla,” Keena said."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45c1d687-7a9f-423b-a10e-020a151e08ff",
                                "sense_id": "0239f04f-6b6e-3671-9eaf-0acd25a6af4d",
                                "text": "Beyond Baroque, she says, “was the big magilla” to which they all aspired."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "46e47491-01ac-4bb7-8702-44150fa5cf47",
                                "sense_id": "0239f04f-6b6e-3671-9eaf-0acd25a6af4d",
                                "text": "But this Hawthorne thing is the big magilla. It will include everything a Las Vegas casino has, all that and table games."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3d22d9fa-48ee-388d-8ef9-f1a9de9a203d",
                        "entry_id": "20efce00-cc2b-3c00-8d0d-739d671f2aaa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone big and brutish; gorilla."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bffa6828-0eb3-42cb-a2b7-d57fad5dc3f7",
                                "sense_id": "3d22d9fa-48ee-388d-8ef9-f1a9de9a203d",
                                "text": "Big, stupid magillas with guns."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30a51329-d2d8-4d03-9599-6893811f975d",
                                "sense_id": "3d22d9fa-48ee-388d-8ef9-f1a9de9a203d",
                                "text": "Those of us in the talk radio dodge can't help but make note of Rush Limbaugh, the thousand-pound magilla in our particular jungle."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
